usage: e2e_warm_reading.py [-h] --rows ROWS --reading READING --openers
                           OPENERS --output OUTPUT

Retain the client harness reading beside a mechanism-evidenced warm reading.
Usage: e2e_warm_reading.py --rows ROWS --reading JSON --openers JSON --output
NEW_JSON Openers map every native repeat side to normalized formal request
IDs. This tool does not identify warmup events or choose exclusions from
request latency.

options:
  -h, --help         show this help message and exit
  --rows ROWS
  --reading READING
  --openers OPENERS
  --output OUTPUT
